# Beast 3.0 System Orchestrator Control Plane

The System Orchestrator is the central nervous system of the Beast 3.0 ecosystem, routing requests, broadcasting events, and synchronizing state across all 21 division repositories.

## Mission

Provide a deterministic, high-performance master control plane that unifies all modular divisions into a cohesive decentralized governance and resource distribution engine.

## Core Responsibilities

- Master Gateway Request Routing & Proxying
- Inter-Division Event Bus & Pub/Sub Messaging
- Ecosystem Health & Module Discovery
- Global Pipeline Coordination

## Connected Systems

- Connects and orchestrates **Divisions 01 through 20** into a unified autonomous network.

## Status

Development
